KAI database migrations

Run all commands from the backend directory so app settings and .env resolve
consistently:

    python -m alembic upgrade head
    python -m alembic current
    python -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

The migration environment reads DATABASE_URL from app.config. Tests may pass a
database_url value through Alembic Config.attributes to isolate temporary
databases without changing process-global application settings.

Revision 0003 normalizes legacy buy request rows in Python and therefore must
run in online mode; do not use `alembic upgrade --sql` for that revision.
